==================================================
SPRINT 7 OBJECTIVE
==================================================

Build a robust, deterministic, append-only Event Log / Audit Trail
abstraction for AG-002.

The architecture should become:

Memory Operations
       ↓
Memory Services
       ↓
Event Creation
       ↓
Event Validation
       ↓
Event Sanitization
       ↓
Event Log
       ↓
Query / Replay / Audit
       ↓
Future Durable Event Store

The current implementation must remain in-process/in-memory.

DO NOT implement Kafka.
DO NOT implement Redis Streams.
DO NOT implement PostgreSQL event storage.
DO NOT implement external queues.
DO NOT implement OpenClaw events.
DO NOT implement external messaging.

This sprint creates the abstraction and correct current implementation.

